      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1 data-section-id=\"1j94cfd\" data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"383\">⚡ THE VALHAULANS</h1><p data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"443\"><em data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"443\">“We regret nothing. We will regret this later. Probably.”</em></p><hr data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"448\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"1opubfn\" data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"474\">✦ Player-Facing Brief</h2><p data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"510\">You hear them before you see them.</p><p data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"610\">Wind splits. Engines scream. Someone is singing—badly, loudly, and with full emotional commitment.</p><p data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"631\">Then the sky opens.</p><p data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"778\">Ships descend like drunken gods—patched hulls, mismatched plating, dragon-hide sails stitched with rope that looks like it remembers being alive.</p><p data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"828\">They land sideways.<br data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"802\" />They always land sideways.</p><p data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"870\">They call themselves <strong data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"869\">The Valhaulans</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"881\">They are:</p><ul data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"984\"><li data-section-id=\"1tbckr6\" data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"893\"><p data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"893\">Raiders</p></li><li data-section-id=\"11p22cv\" data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"905\"><p data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"905\">Traders</p></li><li data-section-id=\"tr61ym\" data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"918\"><p data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"918\">Couriers</p></li><li data-section-id=\"7mons8\" data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"935\"><p data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"935\">Opportunists</p></li><li data-section-id=\"l3gkdx\" data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"984\"><p data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"984\">Occasional heroes (terms and conditions apply)</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"996\">They will:</p><ul data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1149\"><li data-section-id=\"cbgqub\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1020\"><p data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1020\">Steal your supplies</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1ca3ij0\" data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1050\"><p data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1050\">Help you defend your home</p></li><li data-section-id=\"17i06pn\" data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1096\"><p data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1096\">Sell you back your supplies at a discount</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1amvmx\" data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1149\"><p data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1149\">Ask if you need anything else while they’re here</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1184\">They operate under a simple code:</p><blockquote data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1290\"><p data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1290\"><strong data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1290\">“If we take it, it’s ours. If we give it back, it’s a favor. If we sell it to you, it’s business.”</strong></p></blockquote><p data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1310\">They are not evil.</p><p data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1330\">They are not good.</p><p data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1358\">They are <strong data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1357\">enthusiastic</strong>.</p><hr data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1363\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"3ljn91\" data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1399\">✦ Leadership: Sklar Bjrornholdt</h2><p data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1432\">Valkyrie. Captain. Catastrophe.</p><p data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1525\">Sklar Bjrornholdt leads like a thunderclap—decisive, inspiring, and frequently mid-mistake.</p><ul data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1648\"><li data-section-id=\"1qu5rd8\" data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1555\"><p data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1555\"><strong data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1542\">Presence:</strong> Weaponized</p></li><li data-section-id=\"3vkxfa\" data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1589\"><p data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1589\"><strong data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1571\">Strategy:</strong> Instinct-driven</p></li><li data-section-id=\"z5sygv\" data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1648\"><p data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1648\"><strong data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1613\">Planning Horizon:</strong> “We’ll figure it out in the air”</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1698\">She remembers names.<br data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1673\" />She forgets consequences.</p><p data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1769\">Her crew would follow her into the Collapse itself—and frequently do.</p><hr data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1774\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"13vrfod\" data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1801\">✦ The Truth (GM Layer)</h2><p data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1847\">The Valhaulans are not just chaos merchants.</p><p data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1910\">They are <strong data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1884\">covertly subsidized by</strong> <em data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1909\">Monodynamic Industries</em>.</p><p data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1954\">Not openly. Not officially. Not traceably.</p><p data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1960\">But:</p><ul data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"2119\"><li data-section-id=\"1wxo24b\" data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"2014\"><p data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2014\">Their ships are <em data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"1995\">too functional</em> for scrap builds</p></li><li data-section-id=\"bxf51p\" data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2056\"><p data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2056\">Their fuel supply is <em data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2054\">too consistent</em></p></li><li data-section-id=\"1boqaxv\" data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2119\"><p data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2119\">Their targets sometimes align with <strong data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2117\">corporate interests</strong></p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2144\">They are being used as:</p><ul data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2240\"><li data-section-id=\"1sd1mtt\" data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2169\"><p data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2169\"><strong data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2169\">Soft destabilizers</strong></p></li><li data-section-id=\"1bhonm0\" data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2207\"><p data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2207\"><strong data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2207\">Unattributed acquisition agents</strong></p></li><li data-section-id=\"hpyx3q\" data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2240\"><p data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2240\"><strong data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2240\">Narrative noise generators</strong></p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2266\">They think they’re free.</p><p data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2281\">They are not.</p><hr data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2286\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"rqf39u\" data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2326\">✦ Operational Behavior (On the Map)</h2><p data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2386\">The Valhaulans are a <strong data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2385\">high-mobility disruption faction</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2393\">They:</p><ul data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2553\"><li data-section-id=\"1rt33f5\" data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2456\"><p data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2456\">Appear suddenly (multi-hex travel capability via air routes)</p></li><li data-section-id=\"jmkn5x\" data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2491\"><p data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2491\">Ignore most terrain restrictions</p></li><li data-section-id=\"19do5dv\" data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2553\"><p data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2553\">Create <strong data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2533\">temporary instability spikes</strong> in hexes they touch</p></li></ul><h3 data-section-id=\"pdhp57\" data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2575\">Typical Actions:</h3><ul data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2747\"><li data-section-id=\"cc9v26\" data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2630\"><p data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2630\"><strong data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2630\">Raid (Low Structure Damage, High Resource Theft)</strong></p></li><li data-section-id=\"2htqfk\" data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2671\"><p data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2671\"><strong data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2671\">Trade (Often selling stolen goods)</strong></p></li><li data-section-id=\"ej4c6o\" data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2704\"><p data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2704\"><strong data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2704\">Escort (if paid or amused)</strong></p></li><li data-section-id=\"90bqfa\" data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2747\"><p data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2747\"><strong data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2747\">Intervene unpredictably in conflicts</strong></p></li></ul><h3 data-section-id=\"dmbzrk\" data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2771\">Signature Pattern:</h3><blockquote data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2843\"><p data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2843\"><strong data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2843\">Raid → Charm → Trade → Leave → Return later like nothing happened</strong></p></blockquote><p data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2876\">They are <em data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2875\">non-linear pressure</em>.</p><hr data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"2881\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"1w7yuio\" data-start=\"2883\" data-end=\"2894\">✦ Assets</h2><ul data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"3262\"><li data-section-id=\"19bvotc\" data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2955\"><p data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2955\">Patchwork Airships (fast, unreliable, emotionally stable)</p></li><li data-section-id=\"ei4pca\" data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"3020\"><p data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"3020\">Boarding crews with grapples, ropes, and <em data-start=\"2999\" data-end=\"3020\">aggressive optimism</em></p></li><li data-section-id=\"1he3cpq\" data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3058\"><p data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3058\">Sky routes unknown to most factions</p></li><li data-section-id=\"17s2ryq\" data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3262\"><p data-start=\"3061\" data-end=\"3099\"><strong data-start=\"3061\" data-end=\"3074\">Knot-tech</strong> (seriously—this matters)</p><ul data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3262\"><li data-section-id=\"jsanjq\" data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3262\"><p data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3123\">Their ropework can:</p><ul data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3262\"><li data-section-id=\"1rdxbp5\" data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3150\"><p data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3150\">Stabilize structures</p></li><li data-section-id=\"x1erdg\" data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3170\"><p data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3170\">Bind entities</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1odns5s\" data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3201\"><p data-start=\"3177\" data-end=\"3201\">Anchor airships mid-fall</p></li><li data-section-id=\"vntcta\" data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3262\"><p data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3262\">Possibly interfere with leyline flows (future hook 👀)</p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><hr data-start=\"3264\" data-end=\"3267\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"11t5hv6\" data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3308\">✦ Core Vibe → Mechanical Translation</h2><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3566\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3328\"><tr data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3328\"><th data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3318\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Trait</th><th data-start=\"3318\" data-end=\"3328\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3566\"><tr data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3405\"><td data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3364\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mostly Violence</td><td data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3405\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strong raid bonuses, chaotic outcomes</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3461\"><td data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3423\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Some Diplomacy</td><td data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3461\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Can de-escalate <em data-start=\"3441\" data-end=\"3448\">after</em> escalation</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3462\" data-end=\"3512\"><td data-start=\"3462\" data-end=\"3484\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zero Accountability</td><td data-start=\"3484\" data-end=\"3512\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Ignore certain penalties</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3513\" data-end=\"3566\"><td data-start=\"3513\" data-end=\"3536\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Boundless Enthusiasm</td><td data-start=\"3536\" data-end=\"3566\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rerolls / momentum effects</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><hr data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3571\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"o3g7xk\" data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3623\">✦ Pressure Vectors (What They Do to a Campaign)</h2><ul data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3879\"><li data-section-id=\"1g09doo\" data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3696\"><p data-start=\"3627\" data-end=\"3696\"><strong data-start=\"3627\" data-end=\"3652\">Resource Instability:</strong> Players lose/gain resources unpredictably</p></li><li data-section-id=\"406mkw\" data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3756\"><p data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3756\"><strong data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3719\">Moral Ambiguity:</strong> “They helped us… after robbing us”</p></li><li data-section-id=\"pjfcni\" data-start=\"3757\" data-end=\"3818\"><p data-start=\"3759\" data-end=\"3818\"><strong data-start=\"3759\" data-end=\"3782\">Narrative Whiplash:</strong> Tone shifts fast when they arrive</p></li><li data-section-id=\"nyrcvb\" data-start=\"3819\" data-end=\"3879\"><p data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3879\"><strong data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3846\">Faction Entanglement:</strong> Monodynamic thread can surface</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3884\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"6i0gcz\" data-start=\"3886\" data-end=\"3896\">✦ Hooks</h2><ul data-start=\"3898\" data-end=\"4084\"><li data-section-id=\"14r3kmr\" data-start=\"3898\" data-end=\"3956\"><p data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"3956\">They stole something <em data-start=\"3921\" data-end=\"3932\">important</em>… and don’t realize it</p></li><li data-section-id=\"194nbfa\" data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"3996\"><p data-start=\"3959\" data-end=\"3996\">Sklar offers an alliance mid-crisis</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1w493l5\" data-start=\"3997\" data-end=\"4043\"><p data-start=\"3999\" data-end=\"4043\">A Valhaul ship crashes into a leyline gate</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1mgtkkv\" data-start=\"4044\" data-end=\"4084\"><p data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4084\">Monodynamic “recalls” them—violently</p></li></ul>"
      },
